      "Title": "DeltaPack.DeltaPackTrackedAttribute",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/DeltaPack.DeltaPackTrackedAttribute.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Opt-in change tracking for a <xref href=\"DeltaPack.DeltaPackAttribute\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> class. Mutations\non serialized properties are recorded so <code>EncodeDiff</code> can skip equality\ncomparisons on unchanged fields, producing identical bytes at lower cost.</p>\n<p>Requires the consuming project to set <code>&lt;LangVersion&gt;13&lt;/LangVersion&gt;</code>:\ntracked serialized properties must be declared <code>partial</code> so the source\ngenerator can emit dirty-marking setters. Collection-typed properties should\nuse <xref href=\"DeltaPack.TrackedList%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> / <xref href=\"DeltaPack.TrackedOrderedDict%602\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>\nso mutations inside the collection are also recorded.</p>\n"
    },
