      "Title": "DeltaPack.IDirtyTracked",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/DeltaPack.IDirtyTracked.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Base contract for types that participate in delta-pack's dirty-tracking graph. Exposes\nparent-chain wiring (for propagation) and a snapshot-version slot (used at diff-encode\ntime as the baseline). Implementers fall into two narrower categories —\n<xref href=\"DeltaPack.ITrackedObject\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> for <code>[DeltaPackTracked]</code> classes (slot-keyed dirty\nstorage) and <xref href=\"DeltaPack.ITrackedContainer\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> for <xref href=\"DeltaPack.TrackedList%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> /\n<xref href=\"DeltaPack.TrackedOrderedDict%602\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> (key-keyed dirty storage).</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/DeltaPack.ITrackedContainer.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/DeltaPack.ITrackedContainer.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "DeltaPack.ITrackedContainer",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/DeltaPack.ITrackedContainer.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Implemented by tracked container types (<xref href=\"DeltaPack.TrackedList%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>,\n<xref href=\"DeltaPack.TrackedOrderedDict%602\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>) whose dirty storage is keyed by user-supplied\nindex / key rather than by a compile-time slot.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/DeltaPack.ITrackedObject.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/DeltaPack.ITrackedObject.html"
