      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "DeltaPack.ITrackedObject",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/DeltaPack.ITrackedObject.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Implemented by <code>[DeltaPackTracked]</code> classes. Dirty storage is slot-based — one\n<code>long</code> per declared field, indexed by the compile-time slot assigned by the source\ngenerator. Avoids the string-hash and dictionary-lookup cost of a keyed scheme.</p>\n"
    },
